{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o007b","title":"刘翊传张邈军粮命荀彧察乱召夏侯惇","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o007b-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"刘翊传张邈军粮命荀彧察乱召夏侯惇","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0022","role":"传命","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0100","role":"备乱","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0027","role":"赴援","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":194,"label":"兴平元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xunyu-y194","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xunyu-q-o007","basis":"兴平元年"},"evidence":["xunyu-e-o007b-q","xunyu-q-o007","xianzhu-q-o009","wudi-q-o028","wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o007b-q","source_order":[10,25,"O007b"],"order":2399},{"id":"xumisun-e-o002","title":"刘翊举许靖为计吏","accounts":[{"id":"xumisun-a-d9d190163e396c2356a7","label":"正文","text":"刘翊举许靖为计吏","evidence":["xumisun-q-6d4f0eb5f9001b10a123"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0022","role":"颍川人，任汝南太守，举许靖为计吏","evidence":["xumisun-q-6d4f0eb5f9001b10a123"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0059","role":"被刘翊举为计吏","evidence":["xumisun-q-6d4f0eb5f9001b10a123"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["xumisun-q-6d4f0eb5f9001b10a123"]},"ordering_evidence":"xumisun-q-6d4f0eb5f9001b10a123","source_order":[38,2,71],"order":7005}],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0022","name":"刘翊","evidence":["xunyu-q-o007","xumisun-q-6d4f0eb5f9001b10a123"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-o007-xunyu-p0022","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-o007"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o028","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fefe0240b8480efce927","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年春，太祖自徐州还〖1〗。初，太祖父嵩，去官后还谯。董卓之乱，避难琅邪〖2〗。为陶谦所害，故太祖志在复仇东伐。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o009","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-939a0c2b5149377c476b","layer":"original","quote":"谦表先主为豫州刺史，屯小沛〖2〗。谦病笃，谓别驾麋竺曰〖3〗：“非刘备，不能安此州也！”谦死，竺率州人迎先主。先主未敢当，下邳陈登谓先主曰：“今汉室陵迟，海内倾覆；立功立事，在于今日！（彼）〔鄙〕州殷富〖4〗，户口百万；欲屈使君，抚临州事。”先主曰：“袁公路近在寿春〖5〗；此君四世五公〖6〗，海内所归；君可以州与之。”登曰：“公路骄豪，非治乱之主！今欲为使君合步骑十万：上可以匡主济民，成五霸之业〖7〗；下可以割地守境，书功于竹帛。若使君不见听许，登亦未敢听使君也！”北海相孔融谓先主曰：“袁公路岂忧国忘家者邪？冢中枯骨〖8〗，何足介意！今日之事，百姓与能〖9〗；天与不取，悔不可追！”先主遂领徐州。﹝一﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":304},{"id":"xumisun-q-6d4f0eb5f9001b10a123","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-e177aa8a810d27ad180f","layer":"original","quote":"颍川刘翊为汝南太守，乃举靖计吏","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":71,"end":86},{"id":"xunyu-e-o007b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-0a1838dcb6c559056287","layer":"original","quote":"布既至，邈乃使刘翊告彧曰：“吕将军来助曹使君击陶谦〖5〗。宜亟供其军食！”众疑惑。彧知邈为乱，即勒兵设备〖6〗；驰召东郡太守夏侯惇。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":35,"end":101},{"id":"xunyu-q-o007","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-0a1838dcb6c559056287","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年，太祖征陶谦，任彧留事〖4〗。会张邈、陈宫以兖州反，潜迎吕布。布既至，邈乃使刘翊告彧曰：“吕将军来助曹使君击陶谦〖5〗。宜亟供其军食！”众疑惑。彧知邈为乱，即勒兵设备〖6〗；驰召东郡太守夏侯惇。而兖州诸城皆应布矣。时太祖悉军攻谦，留守兵少；而督将、大吏多与邈、宫通谋〖7〗。惇至，其夜诛谋叛者数十人，众乃定。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
